# The scrambling of GRF entries: Gravity's DES variant, one round with a fixed key, applied in
# place to eight-byte blocks of the compressed bytes. An entry flagged "header" has its first 20
# blocks scrambled; one flagged "mixed" also has every cycle-th block after them scrambled
# (cycle from the number of digits of its packed size) and every 7th other block shuffled.
# The tables are the client's (as grf-loader and every GRF tool carry them).

